From: OpenDesk <opendesk>
Date: 2026-04-02
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Fix PerformDraw timing, font metrics sign, redraw, and diagnostics

Critical fixes:
1. PerformDraw() checked surf->Initialised() before surf->Init(),
   causing canvas=nullptr and all painting silently skipped (white screen).
   Fix: Move Init() before Initialised() check.

2. OH_Drawing (Skia) FontMetrics.ascent returns negative values (Skia Y-axis
   points down, ascent points up), but Scintilla expects positive values.
   This caused negative line height, squishing all text to top-left corner.
   Fix: Negate ascent in GetAscent()/GetHeight()/GetInternalLeading().

3. Window::InvalidateAll/Rectangle were empty stubs, so Scintilla's repaint
   requests were silently dropped. Add redraw callback mechanism so that
   InvalidateAll/Rectangle triggers the host app's RenderFrame.

4. HarmonyOS hilog sanitizes all values to <private>. Use %{public} format
   specifier to make diagnostic values visible.

Files: ohos/PlatOHOS.cxx, ohos/ScintillaOHOS.cxx, ohos/ScintillaOHOS.h
